{CREATECG "111" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカうつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Um... so how many servings is that in all...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Let's see, </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">plus </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Seven servings in all!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> forgot your own!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oops? Silly me!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Honestly, getting old is no fun."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ホワイトノイズ.ogg" "VOICE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah, <STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE>, sorry, could you pass me the ladle?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Here you go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Thanks..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm? What's the matter?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, um... 
{PAUSE ""}
Sorry, I just... forgot to talk politely without noticing."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ指さしバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, I don't mind!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If you like, you can even call me Erika-chan, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Erika...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's my first name. Pretty </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="しゃれ">stylish</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> for someone my age, don't you think?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, it's a really cute name!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ホワイトノイズ.ogg" "VOICE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
