{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Right, that's about done. The search party should be back any time now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Thank you for helping, when you're tired from the long trip."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, cooking with you was so much fun, <STYLE ID="1">Erika-chan</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I had fun too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Usually </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> helps me, but </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> seem to have quite a talent for cooking yourself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> little sister, in fifth grade. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She's out searching right now, so you'll meet her soon enough."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ホワイトノイズ.ogg" "VOICE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Nice to meet you. I'm Natsumi Kogori."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, welcome. I'm Kotaro Niimura, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> uncle. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Thanks for coming all this way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="5">"Now that you mention it, she's not here... wandering around somewhere again, I guess..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Even if it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I'm worried, at a time like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Right, I'll go take a look outside."</STYLE><PG>
