<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="4">, aren't you tired? I can do that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm fine! The food was so good, it gave me my energy back!"
