{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you, </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Come to think of it... are <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> still in the storehouse...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> came back a little while ago and went out for a short walk with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A walk?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"She said she wanted a little fresh air."</STYLE>
