{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, nice to meet you! So you're </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="6">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Um, so you must be <STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yup! I'm Kana Niimura, always peppy and full of life!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE>, you've got so much energy!
{PAUSE ""}
　Come to think of it, is <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> still in the storehouse? <STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE>, I heard you were there..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah, yeah, I came to get </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> dinner. </STYLE>
